Package: rigpanel
Version: @VERSION@
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), xdg-utils
Maintainer: KJ5JDO <codyguilliaume@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/GUAC88/RigPanel
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: Browser control panel for the Yaesu FT-991A
 One-tap Quick Setups (Winlink VARA FM, NOAA weather), frequency, mode, power,
 squelch and tone controls, memory channels, all 153 MENU settings and a
 callsign lookup card. A small local web server talks to the radio over CAT.
